\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {11}{\ignorespaces Reproduction sanity checks, each run in the setting its own paper evaluates rather than in ours; an arrow gives the undefended and defended values that paper reports. Rows are \citet  {qi2024safety}, \citet  {zhang2024backtracking}, \citet  {zou2024circuit}, \citet  {zhao2025door} (both forms), and \citet  {vega2025presto}. Values are percentages except PRESTO, whose StrongREJECT score lies in \([0,1]\); the backtracking entry is the Llama-3-8B SFT+DPO overall rate over that paper's four safety suites. Ours are means over three seeds with seed SD, and every reproduction falls within one seed SD of the published value. \emph  {Impl.}: official code, or our adaptation, with \(\dagger \) adapted layer placement. \citet  {qi2024safety} is reproduced only for its data-augmentation component, the part comparable to mid-generation recovery.}}{20}{table.caption.49}\protected@file@percent }
