\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {15}{\ignorespaces Hard-state mining strategies and budgets. Middle ASR{} is suite S1, on the same test pool as Table~\ref {tab:main-results}; the selection rule and budget were fixed on development before these numbers were read. \(\Delta \)ASR{} per GPU-hour is the improvement over the \(25.9\)\% middle ASR{} of a checkpoint trained without hard-state mining, divided by mining GPU-hours. Reselection stability is the fraction of prompts whose selected state is unchanged when the branch draws are resampled. The two \(B{=}66\) rows are the same configuration.}}{23}{table.caption.63}\protected@file@percent }
